":"SERIES","title":"Your Love So Invincible","logo":"","image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/7dfc318c-f068-4d50-a194-bf810a9b838d.jpg","background_image":"https://cloud02.albox.co/shows/42826900-3bfb-45a8-a418-644041d6ff69.jpg","likes":15,"dislikes":1,"views":4234,"release_date":"1783987200000","season_number":1,"description":"Anna Kusakabe had it all: a high-powered career at a prestigious management consulting firm and a reputation for excellence. But when she abruptly resigns, she claims it’s to pursue financial independence and early retirement. In reality, her life is a chaotic patchwork of whims and temporary gigs. While organizing receipts for a struggling design studio, Anna crosses paths with Mizuki Seo, a brilliant yet notoriously ill-tempered character designer. Though she tries to keep her distance, she can’t ignore his tendency to accept exploitative work from shady clients. What begins as a simple attempt to intervene quickly spirals into an unexpected partnership. As Anna steps into the creative world to help Mizuki, the two polar opposites find their lives – and their professional futures – inextricably linked. Can Anna find the true independence she seeks, or will this messy collaboration change her life forever?","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7}],"value":7,"age":"NC-17"},"background_color":"","current_season_id":24801,"content_control":"FAMILY"}}